// Ch15 B02 talk: Liss beside the bier, narrating the barge's construction to herself (her grief tell). If
// Rhen and Liss repaired the lamp together at Lowlight (ch11_lamp_repaired), she lets him sit with her and
// says only "Don't say anything kind" (a rhyme with Rhen's own Act I line); otherwise she sends him off.
// Sitting with her is the only free action in B02 that changes anything (B14 reads it).
title: ch15_deck_liss
location: ch15/open_sea
---
Liss [grief]: Lacquer over cedar. Pegged, not nailed. Ansedrans peg everything. Tobin said they'd peg the sea down if they could. #line:ch15_deck_liss_001
<<if $ch11_lamp_repaired>>
    -> Sit with her. #line:ch15_deck_liss_002
        @anim rhen sit_beside liss
        Liss [grief]: Don't. Don't say anything kind. #line:ch15_deck_liss_003
        @wait 4.0
        <<if $ch14_vows_spoken>>
            Liss [grief]: I'll learn your quiet. #line:ch15_deck_liss_006 #tn:"Tobin's vow to Merel at the wedding (Ch14), said back to herself by his sister."
            @wait 3.0
        <<endif>>
        <<set $ch15_sat_with_liss = true>>
    -> Leave her be. #line:ch15_deck_liss_004
        @anim rhen step_back
<<else>>
    Liss [cold]: Go and sit somewhere else, Sallow. #line:ch15_deck_liss_005
<<endif>>
===
